---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Me" description="Strategic Advisor — AI & Analytics. Over two decades of experience at the intersection of technology and business strategy.">
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-grid border-b border-edge/5">
    <div class="glow w-[30rem] h-[30rem] bg-cyan-glow/15 -top-40 right-1/4"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 sm:px-8 pt-20 pb-16 sm:pt-28 sm:pb-20">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-glow/80 uppercase mb-4">About Me</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-fg leading-tight">
        Strategic Advisor <span class="gradient-text">— AI &amp; Analytics</span>
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] gap-10 items-start">
      <div class="mx-auto sm:mx-0">
        <div class="w-44 h-44 sm:w-full sm:h-auto sm:aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-edge/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-ink-800 to-ink-700 flex items-center justify-center">
          <img
            src="/images/venu.jpg"
            alt="Venu"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
          />
          <span class="hidden w-full h-full items-center justify-center font-mono text-3xl font-bold gradient-text">VU</span>
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/uppalurivenugopal/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-edge/15 text-mist-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-edge/30 hover:text-fg transition-colors"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M19 0h-14c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v14c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h14c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-14c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.27c-.97 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.76s.78-1.76 1.75-1.76 1.75.79 1.75 1.76-.78 1.76-1.75 1.76zm13.5 12.27h-3v-5.6c0-1.34-.03-3.07-1.87-3.07-1.87 0-2.16 1.46-2.16 2.97v5.7h-3v-11h2.88v1.5h.04c.4-.76 1.38-1.56 2.84-1.56 3.04 0 3.6 2 3.6 4.59v6.47z"/></svg>
          Connect on LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-5 text-mist-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          With over two decades of experience at the intersection of technology and business
          strategy, I specialize in transforming complex organizational challenges into
          high-impact solutions. Having led global engagements at <strong class="text-fg font-semibold">Accenture</strong> and <strong class="text-fg font-semibold">Infosys</strong>, I bring a seasoned perspective to Analytics, Machine Learning, and
          the design of AI Centers of Excellence.
        </p>
        <p>
          I thrive on decoding intricate data to provide C-suite leaders with the actionable
          insights they need to navigate competitive landscapes. My approach is rooted in the
          belief that sustainable growth requires more than just vision — it demands disciplined
          execution and measurable checkpoints.
        </p>
        <p>
          Much like my experience as a <strong class="text-fg font-semibold">passionate marathoner</strong>, I view every business
          objective as a journey that requires long-term planning, resilience, and a relentless
          focus on the finish line.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
